    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bibbidiba fan game</strong> is a vibrant and fast-paced platformer that brings Hoshimachi Suisei\u2019s hit song &quot;Bibbidiba&quot; to life in an entirely new way. Players step into the shoes of Hoshimachi Suisei, navigating through magical worlds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nothing stands on your way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players traverse beautifully crafted levels, they must a combination of jump, punch,\u00a0and of course, throwing shoes to avoid traps and defeat mischievous creatures in order to reach to the end goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tick-tock! Tick-tock!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is always ticking, adding an exciting time pressure element to the game. Players must complete each level before the clock runs out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And More?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can take on optional boss or platform challenge to unlock additional bonuses.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is published under CCMC Corp(\u203b1)'s Indie game brand &quot;holo Indie&quot;.(\u203b2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is allowed to be monetized under the examination and terms of &quot;holo Indie&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that any monetized derivative work games that include Cover Corp.'s content outside of holo Indie is not covered by these terms and is not allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b2. About &quot;holo Indie&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game brand that offers &quot;Game 